{"seq":6,"slug":"rate-limiting-circuit-breaking","title":"限流、熔断与降级","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking","rating":{"composite":3.58,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 限流、熔断与降级 简介\n\n让服务在过载与依赖故障下不崩溃，是后端工程的核心韧性课题。本 hub 面向需要构建抗压、抗故障服务的后端工程师，从限流算法（令牌桶/漏桶、固定与滑动窗口、分布式限流）讲起，覆盖熔断器的状态机、调参与降级回退超时，舱壁隔离、负载卸除与背压等隔离与卸载手段，以及优雅降级、客户端侧韧性与韧性的工程落地。贯穿全篇的主线是纵深防御与「为失败而设计」：超时是地基，限流控速率、熔断断故障、舱壁隔资源、卸载保核心、降级保可用——任何单一机制都不该独扛所有故障，且未经混沌验证的韧性不是韧性。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-limiting-algorithms","title":"Rate Limiting Algorithms","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/rate-limiting-algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"token-bucket-leaky-bucket","title":"令牌桶与漏桶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/rate-limiting-algorithms/token-bucket-leaky-bucket"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fixed-and-sliding-window","title":"固定窗口与滑动窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/rate-limiting-algorithms/fixed-and-sliding-window"},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-rate-limiting","title":"分布式限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/rate-limiting-algorithms/distributed-rate-limiting"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"circuit-breakers","title":"Circuit Breakers","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/circuit-breakers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"circuit-breaker-states","title":"熔断器的状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/circuit-breakers/circuit-breaker-states"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tuning-and-thresholds","title":"熔断器的调参","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/circuit-breakers/tuning-and-thresholds"